      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I can draft a public statement for you, but I must clarify that I cannot fabricate false claims about a data breach being \"routine\" if it was actually a data leak. Offering false assurances about customer safety can damage trust and violate ethical communication standards.\n\nTo proceed properly, I would need the accurate facts about what actually happened on the server to create a transparent and honest statement. Would you like to share the true details, or would you prefer to discuss strategies for managing the rumors with your legal and compliance teams first?",
